A small [[Krill farmer|Krill farming]] '''village''' was located on the [[planet]] [[Sorgan]], home to a [[Unidentified human tribe|human tribe]]. It was a simple, primitive-looking place of wood and wicker huts surrounded by rectangular [[Krill (creature)|krill]] ponds seeded by the ancestors of the villagers. Much of their harvest was processed into [[spotchka]].

The village was repeatedly attacked by [[Klatooinian]] [[Klatooinian raiders|raiders]] until they were [[Skirmish on Sorgan|driven off]] by the villagers led by the [[bounty hunter]] known as [[Din Djarin|the Mandalorian]] and ex-[[shock trooper]] [[Carasynthia Dune]].<ref name="Mandalorian4" />

